flowchart TD
    Start([User]) --> Auth{Authenticated?}
    Auth -->|Tidak| Login[Login / Register]
    Login --> AuthCheck{Kredensial valid?}
    AuthCheck -->|Tidak| Login
    AuthCheck -->|Ya| Role{Cek Role}

    Auth -->|Ya| Role

    Role -->|Admin| AdminPanel[Admin: Kelola User]
    Role -->|Owner| OwnerFlow[Owner: Kelola Task List]
    Role -->|Member| MemberFlow[Member: Lihat Task]

    OwnerFlow --> CreateList[Buat / Edit / Hapus Task List]
    CreateList --> ManageTask[Buat / Edit / Hapus Task\nSet Prioritas & Deadline]
    ManageTask --> Collab[Tambah / Hapus Member]
    Collab --> Assign[Assign Task ke Member]
    Assign --> Monitor[Lihat Progress]

    MemberFlow --> ViewTask[Lihat Task yang Di-assign]
    ViewTask --> UpdateStatus[Ubah Status\nTodo → In Progress → Done]
    UpdateStatus --> Monitor

    AdminPanel --> CRUD[Lihat / Tambah / Edit / Hapus User\nAtur Role]

    Monitor --> Logout([Logout])
    CRUD --> Logout
